# Local model checkouts (HF repos; GBs of weights — inputs, never sources).
# *.safetensors covers the weights in any current/future checkout; named dirs
# cover whole checkouts; the sidecar patterns below cover tokenizer/config
# files wherever a checkout lands (a stray `git add -A` must never sweep a
# 32MB tokenizer.json or model weights into git or git-lfs).
*.safetensors
tokenizer.json
tokenizer_config.json
tokenizer.model
special_tokens_map.json
added_tokens.json
generation_config.json
processor_config.json
chat_template.jinja
*.safetensors.index.json
functiongemma-270m-it/
gemma-4-E4B-it/
